        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9964 / JAW-9960)\n- Same workflow file: architecture stub **JAW-9964** is implemented here; behavior in **JAW-9960**.\n- Webhook `POST /generate-email-for-remaining-contacts` with **Outreach Webhook Header Auth**; OpenAI via **Outreach OpenAI OAuth**.\n- `contactId` + `tone`; winning template via optional `winningVariantId` or latest row in `email_winning_variants` for the contact.\n- Personalize with customer overview child **jaw9940-customer-overview**; validate greeting + `Best regards,`; regenerate up to 3×.\n- Store `contact_personalized_emails`; errors surfaced via `workflow_error_logs` + Gmail → `$env.ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL` (not silent).",
